This package acquires third-party dependencies behind per-engine extras. Their
licenses are recorded in the SBOM the CI license lane produces, and the notable
ones are:

    docling (extra)      Copyright IBM Corp. MIT.
    paddleocr (extra)    Copyright PaddlePaddle Authors. Apache-2.0.
    paddlepaddle (extra) Copyright PaddlePaddle Authors. Apache-2.0.

The OCR engine is PaddleOCR rather than Surya, and licensing is the first reason
rather than the last: PaddleOCR is Apache-2.0, which an Apache-2.0 distribution
can name as an optional dependency without qualification, while Surya is
GPL-3.0-or-later with a separate commercial grant whose terms depend on the
adopter's revenue. Neither engine is vendored here, and model weights are
downloaded by the operator into the operator's environment under the engine's
own terms.
